  "body": "Attrs 20.1.0 introduced a \"Next-gen API\", see https://www.attrs.org/en/stable/names.html#tl-dr . From https://www.attrs.org/en/stable/api.html#attrs.define this basically contributes a bunch of sensible defaults (auto-detect auto_attribs; slots by default, opt-in ordering). This is slightly nicer from our POV as it makes it harder to forget to write `slots=True` etc.",
